{"title": "Hammer of the Just", "pageid": 9584, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hammer_of_the_Just", "categories": ["Bugs", "Equipment", "Weapons", "Melee weapons", "Martial weapons", "Warhammers", "Rare items", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage", "Sources of Radiant damage", "Radiant set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warhammer_PlusOne_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Warhammer_PlusOne_Icon.png/300px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/d1/Warhammer_PlusOne_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Hammer of the Just image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Warhammer_PlusOne_Icon.png/300px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Warhammer_PlusOne_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Hammer of the Just</span></a> is a rare +2 <a href=\"/wiki/Warhammers\" title=\"Warhammers\">Warhammer</a> which allows the wielder to cast <a href=\"/wiki/Detect_Thoughts\" title=\"Detect Thoughts\">Detect Thoughts</a> and deals additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radian\">Radiant</span> damage. It also deals additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span> damage to Fiends and Undead.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Tyr is often known as the Maimed God - a descriptor he shares with most victims of this heavy warhammer.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>One-handed damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d8 + 2 (3~10) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Two-handed damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/44px-D10_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/58px-D10_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/D10_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d10 + 2 (3~12) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Extra damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/D4_Radiant.png/31px-D4_Radiant.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/D4_Radiant.png/46px-D4_Radiant.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/D4_Radiant.png/62px-D4_Radiant.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/D4_Radiant.png/31px-D4_Radiant.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/D4_Radiant.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">1d4 (1~4)  <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warhammers\" title=\"Warhammers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Warhammers_Icon.png/25px-Warhammers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Warhammers_Icon.png/38px-Warhammers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Warhammers_Icon.png/50px-Warhammers_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warhammers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Warhammers_Icon.png/25px-Warhammers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Warhammers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warhammers\" title=\"Warhammers\">Warhammers</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/38px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Dippable Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.pn